    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_007:5c68d197",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_005_01_007",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_007:5c68d197",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_007:5c68d197",
        "jp_sha256": "a433043d73dafc63ee7c4f3cbeb6a4aa8d4e165205b3deed39118adec0d94339",
        "official_en_sha256": "b3902bed4530575e7279ac8b83f77ce1edee8b2b7b009cb9d9f2c70c0d671ea7"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、他の国にいけるなら\r\n母さんだけでも、もっと綺麗な土地に……\r\nそう子供心に思ったもんだ。",
        "official_en": "Being just a kid, I always thought that we should move to somewhere with less soot in the air—somewhere better for my mom.",
        "real_en": "As a kid, I thought that if we could go to another country, at least Mom could live somewhere more beautiful..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
