    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_013:24c8e602",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_005_01_013",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_013:24c8e602",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_013:24c8e602",
        "jp_sha256": "94be3073d5475513ed48ca5138c21af7490b2688ec602e7e810221f9699f6732",
        "official_en_sha256": "e9daf98a6802c1129a0cd81367b313887dd3e8d136c7fa7cdd704cb8bb372d82"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、最後だけでも\r\n二人の時間を……\r\n二人だけの時間を、過ごしたかったんだろう。",
        "official_en": "That’s why I’m sure they wanted this: time alone somewhere, all to themselves, before the end.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
