    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_018:6355ebfa",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_005_01_018",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_018:6355ebfa",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_018:6355ebfa",
        "jp_sha256": "10cb1e9a6c135ef724eabe70a7b950672aa16c65a8e9167004c29791bdc19b75",
        "official_en_sha256": "8add7a6b105179dfd658d1e5723fb75c8dd64659094e5a39d01fc53f0cad25b0"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、オヤジ。\r\nあんたが皇帝にならなきゃ\r\nゾルダードはもっと混乱していたさ。",
        "official_en": "But you know, if you didn’t become the emperor, Zoldaad would’ve been in even worse shape.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
