    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_005:b6e67108",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_005_01_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_005:b6e67108",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_005:b6e67108",
        "jp_sha256": "f8afc98db9f74e0e2c7e02cf04b079431c2a57957ee683f332854d586890339a",
        "official_en_sha256": "5705e4c4c8b89f98350115c7eadbfa87772b0d2be76b2148c5117b786c6185c5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なのに、実際には帝都を離れることはなかった。\r\nガキの頃、俺はそれが不思議だった。",
        "official_en": "But she never ended up moving away. I always thought that was strange as a kid.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
