      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "オヤジ……あんたは……\r\n後悔したんだろう？",
        "official_en": "...Well, pops, you probably regretted a lot.",
        "real_en": "Dad... You regretted it, didn't you?"
      },
      "review": {
