        "official_en_sha256": "0b8443412c48d7811516d92e949d5630b44df87d4d2621169178571768c38199"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "オヤジは結局、死ぬまでそれを\r\nしてやることができなかった。",
        "official_en": "But pops never took her away from the capital. Not until she was at death’s door.",
        "real_en": "In the end, Dad never managed to do that for her before it was too late."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
