    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_006:eb0f5cc7",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_005_01_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_006:eb0f5cc7",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_005_01:ChrEv_0070_005_01_006:eb0f5cc7",
        "jp_sha256": "582e212f288c5765bff74c98a59fab908ba8f8129abd085987c479cb5adbdeca",
        "official_en_sha256": "e30f476ff7d75bd340bf2abf406b7ec70f0680ff7153ba7106fe5ebd4a77afce"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "当時、帝都は環境も悪化していて、\r\n病気に良くないのは明らかだった。",
        "official_en": "I mean, the air wasn’t as clean as it used to be in the capital—it was obvious that it wasn’t a good place for the sick.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
